Automations are often QoL changes to the game rewarded after [[achievements]], [[trials]], milestone completions, and in the Infinity Tree.
== Unlocked in Infinity ==
=== Autobuy Buyables ===

Unlocked in [1;1] in the Infinity Tree for {{Keyword|ip|1 IP}}

Automatically purchases colors when affordable.

When unlocked, immediately put all colors on 100%. Keep these on for the rest of the run.

=== Auto Ascend ===

Unlocked in [2;2] in the Infinity Tree for {{Keyword|ip|1 IP}}.

Automatically ascends colors upon reaching the required level.

When unlocked, immediately enable all colors.  Keep these on for the rest of the run.

=== Auto Prestige ===

Unlocked in [5;3] in the Infinity Tree for {{Keyword|ip|3 IP}}.

Automatically prestiges when the requirements you set are met.

When unlocked, put it on 0.00, 1,000, 0.20. When reducing times for infinity challenges, turn auto promote off and turn auto prestige off or put on 1.00, 1e20, 0.00. Upon reaching EC milestone 2, put it on 0.00, 1.01, 0.00. This milestone is reset upon Unity, so follow the "when unlocked" part again (maybe slighty increase it), but once beating 3 Trials, due to getting 6 free EC, you will permanently have this milestone. Now just use 0.00, 1.01, 0.00.

=== Auto Promote ===

Unlocked in [10;1] in the Infinity Tree for {{Keyword|ip|256 IP}}.

Automatically promotes, in the order, level and delay you desire.

When unlocked, [???] (around 10-25lvls, 0s delay?) Upon reaching Animal Milestone 4, put all on 1 lvl 0s.  This milestone is reset upon Unity, so follow the "when unlocked" part again (maybe slightly decrease seconds and increase levels), but once you beat all Easy Trials, the reward for beating all of them makes it so you can put it on 1 lvl 0s.

=== Auto Infinity ===

Unlocked in [15;1] in the Infinity Tree for {{Keyword|ip|2048 IP}}.

Automatically infinites when the IP gain and time requirement are met.

When unlocked, [???] (not all that useful upon unlocking) After reaching Animal Milestone 5, this becomes basically useless. This milestone is reset upon Unity. 

== Unlocked in Eternity ==

=== IP Adjuster ===

Unlocked in the 5th Eternity milestone for reaching 7 Eternities.

Allows to automatically change the IP gain requirement by some factor upon infinity.

When unlocked, set it to 1000-10000.  After reaching Animal Milestone 5, this becomes basically useless. This milestone is reset upon Unity.

=== Autobuy Infinity Tree ===

Unlocked in the 7th Eternity milestone for reaching 12 Eternities.

Automatically buys Infinity tree upgrades when purchasable, buys top to bottom, left to right.

When unlocked, enable it. Keep it like this for the rest of the run.

=== Autobuy Generators ===

Unlocked in the 8th Eternity milestone for reaching 14 Eternities.

Automatically buys generators you enabled, when purchasable.

When unlocked, fully enable it. Keep it like this for the rest of the run.

=== Autobuy Stars ===

Unlocked in the 9th Eternity milestone for reaching 16 Eternities.

Automatically buys stars, star base and factor, as well as stardust upgrades. (Stardust upgrades are ordered so that the second upgrade is the one on the top right.)

When unlocked, fully enable it. Keep it like this for the rest of the run.

=== Auto Eternity ===

Unlocked in the 9th Eternity milestone for reaching 16 Eternities.

Automatically eternates when the EP gain and time requirements are met

When unlocked, you can adjust it to whatever fits you most. After getting Dilation Tree Upgrade MID-2, it becomes useless. 

=== Auto Slowdown ===

Unlocked in the 2nd Animal milestone for having 4 Animals.

Automatically slows down when lap speed of all colors exceeds the entered value.

When unlocked, it is recommended to put at 500. going slightly off isn't bad. Later on, putting it at 10 is usually the best.

